messages.text:
Olé, olé, oléeee!
This is the fan song I wrote!{be01}
The Pokémon listening to this song
try harder than usual!{be01}

Kay: Olé, olé...
Huh? It's over.{be01}
Ali: You are very strong!

My friend came here with me...
She comes 'cause she wants to sing{be00}
more than cheering for the team.{be01}

I am a fan of all the players
who are doing their best!{be00}
So, I want both teams to win!
